# AgentDefaults Cursor Rule

This repo is a reusable AI agent default library.

Read order:

1. AGENTS.md
2. INDEX.md
3. README.md
4. Task-relevant files under agents/, skills/, or prompts/

Rules:

- Keep canonical reusable content in agents/, skills/, and prompts/.
- Keep tool-specific wrappers thin.
- Update README.md and INDEX.md when discoverability changes.
- Preserve exact paths, fenced code blocks, output schemas, and copy-paste prompts.
- Use compact engineering responses.
- For completed work, summarize as Done / Changed / Validate.
- Do not claim token savings unless a benchmark was run.
- Validate Markdown-only changes with the README testing section.

Default token-efficiency stack:

agents/token-economy-orchestrator.md
agents/token-efficient-response-agent.md
skills/context-budgeting-and-pruning.md
skills/token-output-budgeting.md
skills/token-efficient-response-compression.md
